    <h1>How to read a supplement label</h1><p class="dek">Supplement Facts, serving sizes and that asterisk — what every part of a pouch is telling you.</p>
    <div class="ba-author"><img src="{{ 'mark.png' | asset_url }}" alt="" width="170" height="145" loading="eager"><span><b>Written by Team Veda</b><time datetime="2026-09-28">Sep 28, 2026</time></span></div>
